                                "sense_id": "aa1aa0a4-0561-3db3-b595-59ca4dd46e7e",
                                "text": "Such insights can, however, not be expected from a state of near-total unfamiliarity with what has been going on in a field: innocence may be a good thing, ignorance certainly is not."
